# Previously excluded from the published repo (commit 7f221d2, May 2026).
# Re-included August 2026: the remote is now a private Azure DevOps repo, so the
# reason for hiding internal material no longer applies — and excluding these
# paths meant CI could not exist, E2E specs were not shared, and audit reports
# lived on one machine. Verified before re-including: no live credentials, only
# placeholder connection strings and fake CI test values.

# Browser-pass screenshots. Evidence for one report, not repo content - kept on
# disk, out of git. Deliberately NOT a blanket *.png: the app's own assets are
# tracked.
p4-*.png

